AltoLeverageSwapper::constructor(address,address)
├── given owner is zero even when target is also zero
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner before target validation
└── given owner is nonzero
    ├── when swap target is zero
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
    └── when swap target is nonzero
        ├── when target is a contract
        │   └── it should store the immutable SWAP_TARGET exactly
        ├── when target is an EOA
        │   └── it should accept and store the address without interface validation
        ├── it should store the supplied owner
        ├── it should leave owner and deployer unwhitelisted
        └── it should emit only OwnershipTransferred from zero to owner
